    "title": "REMETTE Button+Liner Lock EDC Knife Folding Pocket Outdoor Survival EDC Knife Hand Lapping 14C28N Blade Military Green Micarta Handle Rhino-MC25A",
    "body_html": "<p><strong>REMETTE Rhino</strong><span> </span>--- Made of Stonewashed 14C28N steel, combining edge retention, high hardness and corrosion resistance. The folding 4.33-inch EDC knife is perfect for everyday carry, and the sophisticated gift box and practical accessories make it a great gift for men and women.</p>\n<p><br><strong>Three Deployment Modes</strong><span> </span>--- This folding knife opens with a button lock, front flipper and thumb stud. As a sharp tool, it not only provides convenience for daily opening of express, packages, letters, etc., but also for decompression operations when bored.</p>\n<p><br><strong>Safety Button Lock</strong><span> </span>--- The pocket knife uses ceramic ball bearings, and the base plate is added with a lining structure to fix the blade position after opening, effectively preventing the knife from accidentally closing during use.</p>\n<p><br><strong>Comfortable Grip</strong><span> </span>--- Ergonomic handle with linen material provides a comfortable grip and performs well in wet conditions. The weight-saving design makes this pocket knife light to carry, yet strong and powerful at the same time.</p>\n<p><br>When we are outdoors for camping, hunting, tactical survival, hiking, fishing, climbing and other activities, a sharp and durable pocket knife will solve the difficulties for us, it can carry out branch and rope cutting, and also provide security for defense.</p>\n<h4><strong>Product Specifications:</strong></h4>\n<p>Model Number:<span> MC25A</span><br>Model Name:REMETTE Rhino Knife<br><br>Overall Length: 7.28\" / 185mm<br>Blade Length: 3.07\" / 78mm<br>Closed Length: 4.33\" /<span> </span>110mm<br>Blade Thickness: 0.12\" / 3.0mm<br>Handle Thickness: 0.53\" / 13.5mm<br>Knife Weight: 4.05oz / 114.82g<br><br>Blade Material: 14C28N<br>Blade Grind: Flat<br>Blade Finish:<span> Ceramic Sandblasting Effect</span><br>Blade Type: Drop Point<br><br>Handle Material: Micarta<br>Handle Color/Finish:<span> Military Green</span><br><br>Pocket Clip: Tip-Up, Right<br>Clip Material:<span> Stainless Steel</span><br>Screws / Thumb Stud Material: Stainless Steel<br>Pivot Assembly: Caged Ceramic Ball Bearing<br>Locking Mechanism: Button+Liner Lock</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0840/0001/4630/files/1_0fcd5e8e-eff0-4880-9511-b32c3e085e26_1024x1024.jpg?v=1783134853\" alt=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0840/0001/4630/files/2_eb8e051a-ed01-40ae-9dde-a2f2e18548d9_1024x1024.jpg?v=1783134854\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0840/0001/4630/files/3_55b882b7-2785-4803-8239-5cbc270cd350_1024x1024.jpg?v=1783134854\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0840/0001/4630/files/4_7f24a522-b2bd-4ba2-903e-f7f2d4967dfb_1024x1024.jpg?v=1783134854\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0840/0001/4630/files/5_14be0075-9edf-4878-b378-6bb9c2df602f_1024x1024.jpg?v=1783134854\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0840/0001/4630/files/6_5342e3a3-4e59-4e15-b848-a59880a687e7_1024x1024.jpg?v=1783134854\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0840/0001/4630/files/7_b61bf61a-6812-4c13-aba2-ed3bebed336e_1024x1024.jpg?v=1783134853\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\">\n</div>",
